{
  "era": "wotlk",
  "format": "living-azeroth-npc-summaries",
  "map": 269,
  "npcs": [
    {
      "entry": 15608,
      "name": "Medivh",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15608:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ea465b2b7279bd26fce1db53",
            "source:9df3cefdb08fda829074a90a",
            "source:e358ace6040a7a4315bdaa59",
            "source:a12365c159e8c8fd33acb7df",
            "source:5c357302be6287094bbbaa77"
          ],
          "text": "Medivh is met in the past through the Caverns of Time. Shown the restored apprentice's key, he recognizes it as Khadgar's, which he has not yet given him, and speaks of memories of future events. He calls Khadgar an ideal apprentice and hands over a key of his own.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15608
          }
        },
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15608:portal",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:24896bb745295fa7dbefb5c2",
            "source:9b8a0bc233ebeba39905b352",
            "source:3c211789d8dad8b1d2e98710",
            "source:278b841750c89a0a3839ec3d"
          ],
          "text": "While concentrating on the portal, Medivh calls for the champions’ aid as his shield weakens. If the portal opens, he welcomes Gul’dan’s Horde into Azeroth, believing its invasion will fulfill his plans.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15608
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 17952,
      "name": "Darkwater Crocolisk",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:17952:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:7a3b41cd40b064461ddcf8cb",
            "source:e3afeccfdd7e0b2f7ef5181e",
            "source:2d8b19eb1c5c5ffe2fb2aef1"
          ],
          "text": "Darkwater crocolisks are beasts that attack with a jagged-tooth snap.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 17952
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18982,
      "name": "Sable Jaguar",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18982:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:42bd81df191f94785fa1b6c0",
            "source:95b0743f99c3e7714d22cc68"
          ],
          "text": "A sable jaguar, a beast of the Black Morass.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18982
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18983,
      "name": "Blackfang Tarantula",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18983:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:783f6c3067fa1c4429eb22ce",
            "source:77814c633ca922071357aaaf"
          ],
          "text": "A Blackfang tarantula of the Black Morass.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18983
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 20201,
      "name": "Sa'at",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:20201:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:52b605a65317186947f53f20",
            "source:17d2d23dfa49fa45bc022ab5",
            "source:a78e82eb2379e78d27fa135a",
            "source:92ba6771bf2e3b18e02514b9",
            "source:3ad285835c94b6e9821cc268",
            "source:d9006f5379546c4167af7854",
            "source:ab816131e46c0b73a30261fe",
            "source:2931a78d4385a852b9368364"
          ],
          "text": "Sa'at is a Keeper of Time who guides visitors through the Black Morass timeway and prepares them to defend Medivh during the opening of the Dark Portal. He warns the unprepared and offers chrono-beacons.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 20201
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Keepers of Time"
    }
  ],
  "place": "The Black Morass",
  "place_records": [
    {
      "authored": false,
      "id": "zone:2366",
      "layer": "zone",
      "priority": 40,
      "sources": [
        "dbc:area:2366",
        "dbc:area:981",
        "dbc:area:440",
        "world:quest:10297",
        "dbc:encounter:287",
        "dbc:encounter:291",
        "world:creature:17952",
        "world:creature:18982"
      ],
      "text": "You are in The Black Morass, a timeway reached through The Gaping Chasm in Tanaris. Medivh works in its heart to open the Dark Portal, and rifts open across the morass as the Infinite send their rift lords to stop him. Chrono Lord Deja and Aeonus are among its lords, and the morass is filled with crocolisks, sable jaguars and other beasts.",
      "when": {
        "zone_id": 2366
      }
    }
  ],
